  "interpretation": "<ol data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"2551\">\n<li data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"2218\">\n<p data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1940\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1938\">Positive (Pathogenic / Likely Pathogenic Variant):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2218\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2051\">\n<p data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"2051\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Indicates a <strong data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1994\">hereditary cancer predisposition</strong> (e.g., breast, ovarian, pancreatic, prostate cancers).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2140\">\n<p data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2140\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">May qualify for <strong data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2099\">PARP inhibitor therapy</strong> (e.g., Olaparib) in affected patients.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2218\">\n<p data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2218\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Recommend <strong data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2194\">cascade testing for family members</strong> and genetic counseling.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2362\">\n<p data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2269\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2267\">Variant of Uncertain Significance (VUS):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2362\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2362\">\n<p data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2362\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Clinical significance unknown; may need <strong data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2341\">periodic re-evaluation</strong> as more data emerge.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2551\">\n<p data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2382\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2380\">Negative:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2551\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2434\">\n<p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2434\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No clinically significant variants detected.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2551\">\n<p data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2551\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Does not rule out all hereditary cancer risk (could be due to non-HRR genes or undetected structural variants).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>",
